WEBVTT

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:46.600
Oji-san.  How much longer will we stay in this city?

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.700
We'll wait here for Esal to send word.

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:55.090
She'll let us know when her side of things clear up, so we're stuck here for a while.

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:15.630
Ah, right.  Tomorrow's the Queen's 60th birthday.

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:19.330
These must be the gifts to be given to her during the ceremony.

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:21.790
Ceremony...

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:35.260
The Targeted Queen

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.470
Seimiya-sama!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.040
It is time now!

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.590
Seimiya-sama!

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:51.080
I'm right here, Nami!

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.920
Seimiya-sama.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:59.030
I was gathering flowers to decorate the dinner table.

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.990
If you had asked me, I would have taken care of it.

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:08.480
Look.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.890
Aren't they adorable?

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:14.500
How does filling the <i>entire</i> room with them sound?

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:18.000
But you must get ready soon.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.880
The Grand Duke and Shunan-sama will arrive shortly.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:23.600
Shunan...

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.630
This place hasn't changed at all.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.230
Pure and peaceful.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.800
It's like the area within a shrine where the god lives.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:52.560
The only reason why this palace can remain so defenseless is because we, the Grand Duke's army, are protecting this country.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:11.730
I, along with Ngan, am fully aware of that fact, Father.

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.290
Ngan-sama.

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:28.010
A letter from Damiya-sama at the palace.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.350
What?  From Damiya-sama?

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.520
Read it out loud.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.060
Yes, sir.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.990
"I wish you the best of luck at the ceremony."

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:38.750
That is all.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.030
I see.  Damiya-sama said that.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.980
Welcome,

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.770
Grand Duke Oran and Shunan.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:58.540
Look at how much that little Shunan grew.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.010
He's twenty now, isn't he?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:05.760
I don't want to admit it, but no wonder I've aged.

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:09.330
I became taller than Father three years ago.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:13.800
Damiya often tells me about you and your brother.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:16.580
I've been looking forward to meeting you.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.060
Right, Seimiya?

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:19.310
Yes.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.990
Looks like his body isn't the only thing that's matured.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:36.210
The eyes with which you gaze at Princess Seimiya with are another sign that you've matured.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.560
Don't mind him, Shunan.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:46.610
As you're well aware, dear Uncle likes to tease people like that.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.460
Those were words of compliment to Shunan.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:55.110
Men mature by learning how to love beautiful things.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:58.150
It's rude to group him with you.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:05.390
But he's right.  No man's heart would fail to skip a beat after seeing the beautiful Princess Seimiya.

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:09.890
However, my son knows his place very well.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.250
Of course, Grand Duke Oran.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.940
We have never doubted him.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:19.630
Forgive my shallow nephew.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:23.850
I just wanted to say that Shunan is a great man.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:32.560
When he becomes the Grand Duke, those Saigamuru shall disappear.

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:44.590
<i>A threat letter saying that a poison was mixed into the supplies was delivered, and this was retrieved after a thorough search. </i>

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.240
<i>Saigamuru...</i>

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.210
<i>Don't thoughtlessly mention that name!</i>

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:57.210
<i>But some from the Saigamuru have been known to rebel against the Queen as well as to revolt.</i>

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:05.780
As you say, there are those with rebellious intentions in the Grand Duke's quarter.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:10.300
We are responsible for their presence.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:15.410
However, we have never forgotten our honor toward the Queen!

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:22.770
You really are honest and dependable.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:32.030
Shunan.  Please give your best efforts for this country and my granddaughter, Seimiya, the next Queen.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.140
Most certainly.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.180
Shunan.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:54.660
Hey, Nami...  That was my first time being looked at like that by a man.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:57.200
Seimiya-sama.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.170
What is it, Nami?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:02.580
Um...

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:09.070
I've wondered if I should give this letter to you or not, but...

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:28.090
Ial.  Tomorrow's a day to celebrate.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.480
How does a pre-celebration sound?

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.800
No thanks.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.320
You're so unsocial.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.980
Damn, that was a bad throw.

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:02.440
I'm right here.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.190
Seimiya-sama.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:11.760
I give my deepest apology for the summons I made, for disrespecting the social difference.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:15.620
Shunan. Please lift your head.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:20.270
What is the important thing you talked about in this letter?

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.910
Seimiya-sama.  This is my...

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:28.730
Please hear what I have to say, as I speak freely.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:38.470
I believe there is no future for this Holy Kingdom of Ryoza if things continue in their current state.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:45.710
That's not true.  You're here to make sure that doesn't happen.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.190
With all due respect...

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:52.120
The Queen's authority and the Grand Duke's power...

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:58.640
With these two forces separated, this kingdom is starting to grow askew.

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:06.130
That skew cannot be rid of with only our honor toward the Queen.

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:12.820
There is only one way to protect the Queen and yourself.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:16.070
I believe it's to change this world.

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:26.500
Shunan.  Do you like this country?

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.460
I love this country.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.410
Can you hear it?

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.990
The wind is rustling in the trees.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:43.450
The birds that sleep, blanketed by it, will sing a sweet song when the morning comes.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.560
This is a peaceful country where everything is beautiful.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:51.730
The current state is how this country should be.

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:54.440
That is what my Uncle said.

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.890
I also believe that's true.

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:03.160
The Saigamuru are like bubbles which surface in swamps due to decomposition,

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:06.310
but there is a reason why they exist.

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:10.240
Seimiya-sama.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:16.490
I wish to forge a new path with you.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.760
I need you in order to achieve it!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:43.320
I've come, lured by the sweet scent of flowers, and...

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:46.290
Looks like a rendezvous of lovers.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:03.620
Dear Uncle!

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:11.530
The intelligent son of the Grand Duke didn't take this afternoon's joke seriously, did he?

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:16.330
Seimiya.  Return to your room.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.570
Nami was worried about you.

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:21.480
Yes.

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:24.370
Goodnight, Shunan.

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:34.330
Don't be mad at me.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.840
I'm trying to protect her as well.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:47.230
As you know, the seat of the Queen is passed down from mother to daughter.

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:51.640
Therefore I don't have to worry about anything when it's concerning the royal line.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:58.150
That is why I believe my role is to watch them from the side.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.690
Well, you should head back to your room, as well.

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:07.830
I will keep this out of the Grand Duke's ear.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:13.870
Damiya-sama.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:20.080
My brother seems to idolize you.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:24.930
However, I have the experience and independence to stay true to my belief.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.220
Please make a note of that in your mind.

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.630
I shall.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:49.530
This is the sword given to the Grand Duke.

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:54.480
And as long as we have the Touda army,

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.230
This Holy Kingdom of Ryoza is invincible.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:59.820
We have nothing to fear from other countries.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:08.830
Who are you?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:16.310
With all due respect, I was sent here by my master to give this letter to you.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.240
You insurgent!

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:44.430
My master respects you very much.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:49.030
He says you are necessary for this country.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:41.950
I thank all the gods who reside in the Earth and in the Sky for the sixty years that I have been able to live safely.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:47.290
Thank you very much for gathering, everyone.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:50.140
Please enjoy this to your hearts' content.

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.610
It's a moment of celebration, so try to smile.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:03.880
Get back to your post.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.720
Hey, there are three people at my post.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:09.590
You're alone here.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:10.730
There's no problem.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.450
Ah, come on.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:18.570
But would someone dare to do something in a place like this?

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.090
Tight security.

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:23.630
Even the Grand Duke's here, who has the Touda army.

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:33.640
Don't forget.  Saigamuru are people who wish the Grand Duke to be the king of this country.

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:39.630
And this ceremony is a rare occasion where the Queen shows up in public.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:42.460
It's the best opportunity for those guys.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.370
Saigamuru, eh?

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:48.800
Oh yeah, there was a rumor that they were involved in the egg thievery events, wasn't there?

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.650
<i>You must be the egg thief.</i>

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:58.070
<i>No, I haven't stolen one, yet.</i>

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.290
<i>Who ordered you to?</i>

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.830
<i>I'll talk.  I'll speak.  I'll spill it all.</i>

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.210
<i>His name was...</i>

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.820
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:21.720
But why would they go after Touda, when they're the Grand Duke's treasure?

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:24.840
Focus on the security rather than thinking.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.080
Fine.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.310
What's going on?

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:45.500
I wasn't informed of this.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.950
My dear Aunt.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:59.910
I have a little birthday present for you.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.360
Beast-lords?

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:19.610
He brought beast-lords in?

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:38.330
Marvelous, Damiya-sama.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.810
What lofty beast-lords they are.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:42.470
They are magnificent.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:10.400
You handle things here.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.270
Hey.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.110
Did you have them capture that infant?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:24.870
Yes.  With my hopes that you will live long.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:30.120
Really?  Thank you.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:37.300
W-What's this?

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:38.570
What is going on?!

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.720
What are you doing?!  Go capture that man!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:42.700
Hey, are you all right?!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.810
Hey, Ial.  Get a hold of yourself.

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.620
Ial.  Ial!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:53.380
Why did it, just then...

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.360
I can't die, yet.

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.190
Not until I put an end to this.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:04.460
Oh, you were hit by that arrow, too.

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:09.130
I see.  So you saved me.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:16.090
Then I will put an end to this myself...

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:36.580
Erin-chan!

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:38.080
You have a letter!

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:41.550
It's from Esal.

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:43.110
Really?

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:47.710
Here.

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:49.470
Here.

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:51.010
Here.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:52.270
Here!

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:53.550
Here!

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:55.290
Here.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:55.890
Here.

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.610
We'll head to Kazalm tomorrow.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:14.210
Just as Shunan feared, a shadow was starting to prevail in this country where the Queen, the Holy Majesty, governs.

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:29.140
However, Erin had no clue about the shadow or what had happened to the Queen at this time.

00:24:02.070 --> 00:24:04.610
Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center.

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:09.560
This is where we take care of beast-lords that are injured or have completed their duty until their death.

00:24:10.040 --> 00:24:15.640
A rare transfer candidate arrives who wishes to become a beastinarian.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:21.650
The name of the girl with green eyes, brought by my friend Jone, is Erin.

00:24:21.650 --> 00:24:22.840
Kemono no Souja Erin.

00:24:23.300 --> 00:24:25.050
Teacher, Esal.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:30.030
Teacher, Esal
